_to_ebitda":8,"debt_to_ebitda":1.54,"net_debt_to_ebitda":0.8,"f_score":6,"f_score_breakdown":[{"id":1,"category":"盈利能力","desc":"資產回報率 ROA > 0","passed":1,"detail":"當期 ROA = 6.9%"},{"id":2,"category":"盈利能力","desc":"營業現金流 CFO > 0","passed":1,"detail":"自由現金流 = $1,198M"},{"id":3,"category":"盈利能力","desc":"資產回報率持續擴張 (ΔROA > 0)","passed":1,"detail":"回報率穩步領先同業基準"},{"id":4,"category":"盈利能力","desc":"應計利潤品質高 (CFO > 淨利潤)","passed":0,"detail":"真實現金流充沛，無虛報帳面獲利"},{"id":5,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"財務槓桿未惡化 (ΔLeverage ≤ 0)","passed":1,"detail":"總負債資產比率 = 55.0%"},{"id":6,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"短期流動性安全 (ΔLiquidity > 0)","passed":0,"detail":"流動比率 = 1.04"},{"id":7,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"股本未遭稀釋 (ΔShares ≤ 0)","passed":1,"detail":"未大幅增發新股割韭菜"},{"id":8,"category":"營運效率","desc":"毛利率擴張 (ΔMargin > 0)","passed":0,"detail":"產品定價權增強，毛利結構健康"},{"id":9,"category":"營運效率","desc":"資產週轉率提升 (ΔTurnover > 0)","passed":1,"detail":"每單位資產產出效益改善"}],"fair_val":148.17,"default_fair_val":148.17,"premium_pct":-23.3,"is_undervalued":true,"pe_trailing":17.9,"pe_forward":15.8,"pb_trailing":2.9,"pb_forward":2.6,"div_yield":3.62,"ps_ratio":5,"fcf_to_ev":4.52,"fcf_to_mcap":5.02,"liab_to_assets":55,"cash_to_assets":12.8,"current_ratio":1.04,"roe":16.3,"roa":6.9,"moat":{"ticker":"KOF","period":"2026Q2","m1_brand_pricing":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"可口可樂 FEMSA 作為全球最大的可口可樂裝瓶商，擁有強大的品牌授權與定價能力。其品牌忠誠度極高，消費者對可口可樂系列產品的偏好根深蒂固，使其能夠在不犧牲銷量的情況下維持穩定的價格。儘管面對區域性競爭對手，但可口可樂的全球品牌影響力與 FEMSA 的在地營運網絡結合，形成一道難以逾越的市場壁壘。其產品組合涵蓋多種飲料，滿足不同消費者需求，進一步鞏固了其市場地位與定價權。","comment_en":"As the world's largest Coca-Cola bottler, Coca-Cola FEMSA possesses strong brand licensing and pricing power. Its brand loyalty is exceptionally high, with consumers deeply ingrained in their preference for Coca-Cola products, enabling it to maintain stable prices without sacrificing sales volume. Despite facing regional competitors, Coca-Cola's global brand influence combined with FEMSA's local operational network forms a formidable market barrier. Its product portfolio spans various beverages, catering to diverse consumer needs, further solidifying its market position and pricing power."},"m2_patents_regulatory":{"score":6,"comment_zh":"可口可樂 FEMSA 的核心競爭力來自於其與 The Coca-Cola Company 的獨家裝瓶協議，這實質上是一種特許經營權，賦予其在特定地理區域內生產、分銷和銷售可口可樂產品的權利。雖然沒有專利保護，但這種獨家授權協議構成了顯著的進入壁壘。此外，飲料行業的生產許可證和法規遵循也是營運的必要條件，但這些相對容易獲取，並非其獨有的護城河。其主要壁壘在於品牌授權的獨特性與區域性排他性。","comment_en":"Coca-Cola FEMSA's core competitive advantage stems from its exclusive bottling agreements with The Coca-Cola Company, which essentially act as a franchise, granting it the right to produce, distribute, and sell Coca-Cola products within specific geographic territories. While not protected by patents, these exclusive licensing agreements constitute a significant barrier to entry. Additionally, production licenses and regulatory compliance in the beverage industry are necessary operational requirements, but these are relatively accessible and not its unique moat. Its primary barrier lies in the exclusivity and regional non-competition of its brand licensing."},"m3_high_switching_costs":{"score":5,"comment_zh":"對於終端消費者而言，飲料的轉換成本相對較低。消費者可以輕易地從一種品牌切換到另一種品牌，尤其是在非酒精飲料市場。然而，對於通路商和零售夥伴而言，與可口可樂 FEMSA 的合作關係可能具有一定的黏性，因為 FEMSA 提供廣泛的產品組合、可靠的供應鏈和行銷支持。但這種黏性並非不可逾越，競爭對手若能提供更優的價格或服務，仍有可能爭取到部分通路份額。因此，轉換成本並非其最主要的護城河。","comment_en":"For end consumers, the switching costs for beverages are relatively low. Consumers can easily switch from one brand to another, especially in the non-alcoholic beverage market. However, for distributors and retail partners, the relationship with Coca-Cola FEMSA might have some stickiness due to FEMSA's extensive product portfolio, reliable supply chain, and marketing support. Yet, this stickiness is not insurmountable, and competitors offering better pricing or services could still capture some channel share. Therefore, switching costs are not its most significant moat."},"m4_network_effects":{"score":4,"comment_zh":"可口可樂 FEMSA 的業務本身不直接產生傳統意義上的網絡效應，例如社交媒體或市場平台。然而，其龐大的分銷網絡和與數百萬計零售點的緊密聯繫，可以被視為一種廣義的網絡效應。越多的零售點接入 FEMSA 的分銷網絡，其規模經濟效益越強，對供應商的議價能力也越高，同時也讓競爭對手更難以滲透。這種網絡效應主要體現在供應鏈效率和市場覆蓋廣度上，而非用戶間的互動。","comment_en":"Coca-Cola FEMSA's business does not directly generate network effects in the traditional sense, such as those seen in social media or marketplaces. However, its vast distribution network and close ties with millions of retail points can be considered a form of broad network effect. The more retail points integrated into FEMSA's distribution network, the stronger its economies of scale and bargaining power with suppliers become, while also making it harder for competitors to penetrate. This network effect is primarily reflected in supply chain efficiency and market coverage breadth, rather than user-to-user interaction."},"m5_cost_advantage_scale":{"score":9,"comment_zh":"作為全球最大的可口可樂裝瓶商，可口可樂 FEMSA 享有顯著的規模經濟優勢。其龐大的生產規模、採購量和分銷網絡，使其在原料採購、生產效率、物流運輸等方面都比小型競爭對手擁有更低的單位成本。這種成本優勢不僅體現在其利潤率上，也使其能夠在價格競爭中保持領先地位，或在不損害利潤的情況下提供更具吸引力的價格。這種規模帶來的成本效率是其堅實的護城河。","comment_en":"As the world's largest Coca-Cola bottler, Coca-Cola FEMSA enjoys significant economies of scale. Its massive production volume, procurement power, and distribution network result in lower unit costs in raw material sourcing, production efficiency, and logistics compared to smaller competitors. This cost advantage is reflected not only in its profit margins but also enables it to maintain a leading position in price competition or offer more attractive prices without compromising profitability. This scale-driven cost efficiency is a robust moat."},"m6_unique_geography_assets":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"可口可樂 FEMSA 在拉丁美洲部分地區擁有獨特的市場地位和廣泛的地理覆蓋。其在墨西哥、哥倫比亞、阿根廷等地的市場份額領先，並建立了深入人心的品牌認知度和分銷網絡。這些區域性的市場領導地位和成熟的營運體系，構成了進入壁壘，尤其是在新興市場。雖然這些資產並非獨一無二的實體資產，但其在特定區域的市場滲透率和品牌影響力，使其難以被競爭者複製。","comment_en":"Coca-Cola FEMSA holds a unique market position and extensive geographic coverage in parts of Latin America. It leads in market share in countries like Mexico, Colombia, and Argentina, having established deep brand recognition and distribution networks. These regional market leadership positions and mature operational systems form barriers to entry, especially in emerging markets. While these assets are not unique physical properties, their market penetration and brand influence in specific regions make them difficult for competitors to replicate."},"m7_operational_efficiency":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"可口可樂 FEMSA 在營運效率方面表現出色，這得益於其作為全球最大裝瓶商的經驗和對先進技術的應用。公司持續優化生產流程、供應鏈管理和物流配送，以降低成本並提高響應速度。其精確的庫存管理、高效的生產線運轉以及對市場需求的快速反應能力，都顯示出其卓越的營運管理水平。這種持續的營運效率提升，不僅增強了其盈利能力，也使其能夠更好地服務客戶，鞏固市場地位。","comment_en":"Coca-Cola FEMSA demonstrates outstanding operational efficiency, benefiting from its experience as the world's largest bottler and its adoption of advanced technologies. The company continuously optimizes production processes, supply chain management, and logistics to reduce costs and improve responsiveness. Its precise inventory management, efficient production line operations, and rapid response to market demand showcase its excellent operational management. This sustained improvement in operational efficiency not only enhances its profitability but also enables it to better serve customers and solidify its market position."},"m8_capital_allocation":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"可口可樂 FEMSA 的資本配置策略顯示出其對股東價值的關注。公司在維持穩健的資產負債表（現金充足，負債相對可控）的同時，持續投資於擴張和營運效率提升。其股息政策和潛在的股票回購計劃，也表明了將部分利潤回饋給股東的意願。儘管過去曾進行過一些併購，但整體而言，其資本配置相對穩健，專注於核心業務的有機增長和效率優化，這符合長期價值投資的原則。","comment_en":"Coca-Cola FEMSA's capital allocation strategy reflects its focus on shareholder value. While maintaining a solid balance sheet (ample cash and relatively controlled debt), the company continues to invest in expansion and operational efficiency improvements. Its dividend policy and potential share repurchase programs also indicate a willingness to return a portion of profits to shareholders. Although there have been some acquisitions in the past, overall, its capital allocation is relatively prudent, focusing on organic growth and efficiency optimization of its core business, aligning with the principles of long-term value investing."},"m9_customer_retention":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"可口可樂 FEMSA 的客戶保留率極高，這主要歸功於可口可樂品牌的強大吸引力和消費者忠誠度。一旦消費者習慣了可口可樂的口味和品牌形象，轉換到其他品牌的可能性較低。FEMSA 通過其廣泛的分銷網絡，確保產品的易得性，並透過持續的市場營銷活動，維持品牌在消費者心中的地位。這種由強大品牌和廣泛可及性驅動的客戶忠誠度，構成了其穩定的收入來源和重要的護城河。","comment_en":"Coca-Cola FEMSA enjoys extremely high customer retention, primarily due to the powerful appeal and consumer loyalty of the Coca-Cola brand. Once consumers are accustomed to the taste and brand image of Coca-Cola, the likelihood of switching to other brands is low. FEMSA ensures product availability through its extensive distribution network and maintains the brand's prominence in consumers' minds through continuous marketing activities. This customer loyalty, driven by a strong brand and wide accessibility, forms its stable revenue stream and a significant moat."},"m10_durability":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"可口可樂 FEMSA 的業務模式具有高度的持久性。非酒精飲料是日常消費品，需求相對穩定，不易受經濟週期劇烈波動影響。即使在經濟下行時期，消費者對可口可樂等主流飲料的需求依然強勁。加上其強大的品牌影響力、規模經濟和成熟的分銷網絡，使其能夠抵禦市場變化的衝擊。只要可口可樂品牌持續受到消費者喜愛，FEMSA 作為其主要裝瓶夥伴的地位就能保持穩固，業務的持久性得以保障。","comment_en":"Coca-Cola FEMSA's business model possesses high durability. Non-alcoholic beverages are daily consumer goods with relatively stable demand, less susceptible to severe economic cycle fluctuations. Even during economic downturns, consumer demand for mainstream beverages like Coca-Cola remains strong. Coupled with its powerful brand influence, economies of scale, and established distribution network, it can withstand market changes. As long as the Coca-Cola brand continues to be favored by consumers, FEMSA's position as its primary bottling partner will remain secure, ensuring the durability of its business."},"overall_moat_verdict_zh":"可口可樂 FEMSA 是一家典型的特許經營權公司，其核心護城河來自於與 The Coca-Cola Company 的獨家裝瓶協議，以及由此衍生的強大品牌授權與定價能力。公司享有顯著的規模經濟優勢和卓越的營運效率，使其在成本控制和市場滲透方面領先同業。其在拉丁美洲部分地區的領導地位和廣泛的經銷網絡，構成了難以複製的地理壁壘。雖然轉換成本和網絡效應相對較弱，但憑藉可口可樂品牌的持久吸引力和消費者忠誠度，FEMSA 的業務展現出高度的穩定性和持久性，是一家品質優良的長期投資標的。","overall_moat_verdict_en":"Coca-Cola FEMSA is a classic franchise business, with its core moat derived from exclusive bottling agreements with The Coca-Cola Company, leading to strong brand licensing and pricing power. The company benefits from significant economies of scale and excellent operational efficiency, giving it an edge in cost control and market penetration. Its leadership position and extensive distribution network in parts of Latin America form difficult-to-replicate geographic barriers. While switching costs and network effects are relatively weaker, the enduring appeal and consumer loyalty of the Coca-Cola brand provide Coca-Cola FEMSA's business with high stability and durability, making it a high-quality long-term investment.","evidenceHash":"b573825dca60bf35b7e52a54bb85460ba964c99bb26da26c949c16bd723a5ba8","assessmentPolicy":"buffett-moat-v3","model":"gemini-2.5-flash-lite","provider":"Vertex AI"},"ratingSources":{"moat":{"reason":null},"fScore":{"score":6,"checkedAt":null},"zScore":{"asOfDate":"2025-12-31","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":"z","zone":"grey","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"MXN","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-10-28T14:40:26.418Z","evidenceHash":"cf8695e6e6977b955b2e15bec447b268d1fc6ce64ba1bfb2665e1687b84a3ced"},"mScore":{"asOfDate":"2025-12-31","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":null,"zone":"clean","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"MXN","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-10-28T14:40:26.418Z","evidenceHash":"cf8695e6e6977b955b2e15bec447b268d1fc6ce64ba1bfb2665e1687b84a3ced"}},"fin_valuation":{"is_financial":false},"image":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/KOF.png","logo":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/KOF.png","website":"https://www.coca-colafemsa.com","ceo":"Ian Marcel Craig García","full_time_employees":"108925","description":"Coca-Cola FEMSA, S.A.B. de C.V., operating as a licensed bottler, is engaged in the manufacturing, marketing, sale, and distribution of beverages under the Coca-Cola brand. Its extensive product portfolio encompasses sparkling beverages, including various colas and flavored carbonated drinks, alongside a range of still beverages such as water, juice drinks, coffee, teas, milk, value-added dairy products, and both sports and energy drinks, as well as plant-based alternatives. These products reach consumers through a diverse network of distribution channels, including major retail chains like wholesale supermarkets, discount stores, and convenience outlets; various food service establishments such as restaurants and bars; large venues like stadiums, auditoriums, and theaters; general points of sale; and direct-to-consumer options including home delivery services and standard supermarkets. Furthermore, the company handles the distribution and sale of Heineken beer products within its Brazilian operations. The company maintains operations across several Latin American countries, specifically Mexico, Guatemala, Nicaragua, Costa Rica, Panama, Colombia, Brazil, Argentina, and Uruguay. Established in 1979, its headquarters are situated in Mexico City, Mexico. Coca-Cola FEMSA, S.A.B. de C.V. operates as a subsidiary under Fomento Economico Mexicano, S.A.B. de C.V.","description_en":"Coca-Cola FEMSA, S.A.B. de C.V., operating as a licensed bottler, is engaged in the manufacturing, marketing, sale, and distribution of beverages under the Coca-Cola brand. Its extensive product portfolio encompasses sparkling beverages, including various colas and flavored carbonated drinks, alongside a range of still beverages such as water, juice drinks, coffee, teas, milk, value-added dairy products, and both sports and energy drinks, as well as plant-based alternatives. These products reach consumers through a diverse network of distribution channels, including major retail chains like wholesale supermarkets, discount stores, and convenience outlets; various food service establishments such as restaurants and bars; large venues like stadiums, auditoriums, and theaters; general points of sale; and direct-to-consumer options including home delivery services and standard supermarkets. Furthermore, the company handles the distribution and sale of Heineken beer products within its Brazilian operations. The company maintains operations across several Latin American countries, specifically Mexico, Guatemala, Nicaragua, Costa Rica, Panama, Colombia, Brazil, Argentina, and Uruguay. Established in 1979, its headquarters are situated in Mexico City, Mexico. Coca-Cola FEMSA, S.A.B. de C.V. operates as a subsidiary under Fomento Economico Mexicano, S.A.B. de C.V.","description_zh":"Coca-Cola FEMSA, S.A.B. de C.V.（美股代碼：KOF）為 Consumer Defensive 領域之重要企業，專注於 Beverages - Non-Alcoholic 業務，具備清晰之商業壁壘與現金流創造能力。","address":"Calle Mario Pani No. 100","city":"Mexico City","state":"DF","zip":"05348","country":"MX","phone":"52 55 1519 6179","full_address":"Calle Mario Pani No. 100, Mexico City, DF 05348, MX","range_52w":"84.93-122.14","year_high":122.14,"year_low":84.93,"all_time_high":0,"all_time_low":84.93,"inst_ownership_pct":null,"insider_ownership_pct":null,"top_holders":[],"insider_trades":[{"date":"2026-07-02","name":"Gonzalez Olga","title":"director: ","is_buy":null,"action":"","shares":0,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-05-27","name":"Cutrale Jose Luis","title":"director: ","is_buy":null,"action":"","shares":0,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-05-22","name":"Nicolau Gutierrez Luis Alfonso","title":"director: ","is_buy":null,"action":"","shares":0,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-04-22","name":"Kim LeRoy","title":"director: ","is_buy":null,"action":"","shares":0,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-03-30","name":"Cutrale Jose Henrique","title":"director: ","is_buy":null,"action":"","shares":0,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-03-18","name":"Harris Mark D","title":"director: ","is_buy":null,"action":"","shares":0,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"d